# Terraform

Scope: Event Hubs namespace, hub `hvac-telemetry`, schema group, ADLS Gen2.
No wrapper script. From `infra/terraform/`:

```powershell
copy dev.tfvars.example terraform.tfvars
terraform init
terraform fmt -check
terraform validate
terraform plan
terraform apply
```

CI uses `terraform fmt -check` and `terraform init -backend=false` plus
`terraform validate`.

`dev.tfvars.example`: prefix `hvacpulse`, location `southeastasia`,
8 partitions, 7-day retention, tags `project=hvacpulse`, `environment=dev`.
`terraform.tfvars` and state are gitignored. Outputs the bundle needs are
`eventhub_kafka_endpoint` and `eventhub_name`.
